|  y  | para<br/><br/>{{mymacro param="value"}}line1<br/>line2{{/mymacro}} |
|  z  | <p> html </p><br/><br/>after |
|  w  | before<br/><br/><table class="nested"><tr><th rowspan="2">n1</th><td>n2</td></tr><tr><td colspan="2">n3 \| **n4**</td></tr></table><br/><br/>after |
